  routeNotes: No extra white relay. Lower yellow-side blue plateau to 2.0; white
    floor follows the same source dimensions. Pit width 4.6 and right green rise
    2.75 prevent direct ordinary/bounce exit and main-to-green shortcuts. Raise existing
    right-hand climbing ledges together by 0.7 to retain the blue-box-3 ascent. Start
    floor thickened one box-height. White terrain fill, collision and ink boundary
    are one geometry; flag reflects complete visual hierarchy.
